Package: xios-kde
Name: Xios Desktop (KDE Plasma)
Version: 0.1.20
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.5), xios-core (>= 0.1.11), iosc (>= 0.9.43), xios-session (>= 1.0.75), xios-desktop-theme, libjpeg62-turbo (>= 3.1.1+ios1), kwin (>= 6.1.5+ios31), breeze (>= 6.1.5+ios2), plasma-workspace (>= 6.1.5+ios14), plasma-desktop (>= 6.1.5+ios9), plasma-mobile (>= 6.1.5+ios23), plasma-nano (>= 6.1.5+ios3), systemsettings (>= 6.1.5+ios8), kscreen (>= 6.1.5+ios2), powerdevil (>= 6.1.5+ios1), kf6-kded (>= 6.3.0+ios2), qt6-wayland, kf6-breeze-icons, konsole (>= 24.08.0+ios1), dolphin (>= 24.08.0+ios1), kate (>= 24.08.0+ios4), kwrite (>= 24.08.0+ios3), kcalc (>= 24.08.0+ios1), okular (>= 24.08.0+ios3), ark (>= 24.08.0+ios1), gwenview (>= 24.08.0+ios1)
MinimumOSVersion: 16.5.0
Description: KDE Plasma desktop and mobile flavors for Xios
 KDE Plasma on KWin, rendered on the iPad GPU through the iosc compositor
 and ANGLE. Pulls in the Qt 6 runtime, the KDE Frameworks 6 subset Plasma
 needs, KWin, Plasma Desktop, Plasma Mobile/Nano, System Settings, KScreen,
 PowerDevil, and the shared Xios theme assets used by both shells.
 .
 Every KDE app ported so far comes with it: Konsole, Dolphin, Kate, KWrite,
 KCalc, Okular, Ark, and Gwenview.
 .
 Installing this package is the whole setup: open the Xios app afterwards
 and the Plasma session starts.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.5 or newer. Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
